.venv
__pycache__
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.pytest_cache
node_modules
frontend/dist
.env
# Generated by `make profile-env` (app.config.profile_env, E18-E) — never hand-edited, never
# tracked (it is derived, deterministically, from a profile YAML that IS tracked).
infra/.env.profile
# Generated by `make settings-import` (I5 E37, Q-E16-1) from an ADMIN's `exportSettingsXml` — never
# hand-edited, never tracked (it may hold a deployment's own configuration choices).
infra/.env.settings
/data/
# A test or host run started from backend/ resolves the default `data/recordings` there (E20).
/backend/data/
/models/
*.gguf
benchmarks/results/
READ_AFTER_COMPACT.md
